  "description": "This workflow helps Juliet make LinkedIn posts. It is triggered to use rants that she dumps on Telegram, which are automatically saved in n8n datatables to analyse her thoughts using an imperfect procedure to generate a post that sounds human. there is a quality check in this workflow, where juliet accepts or reject what it generated before posting."
